notes:
  kira:
    title: Kira Thornwood
    short: Reluctant hero with innate fire magic, former blacksmith's apprentice caught between rebels and crown. See [[Demo Notes#Fire magic|her training]].
    long: |
      # Kira Thornwood

      **Age:** 24  
      **Role:** Protagonist, reluctant hero

      ## Background
      Former blacksmith's apprentice from the Northern village of Millhaven. 
      Discovered her innate fire magic when raiders attacked her village.

      ## Arc
      Learning to control her powers while navigating the political 
      minefield between rebels and crown.
    membership:
      narrative: protagonists
      political: northern-rebels
      magic: innate-users
    connections:
      narrative:
        - to: valdric
          label: hunted by
        - to: elena
          label: trained by
      magic:
        - to: temple-amulet
          label: seeks
    width: 260
  valdric:
    title: Lord Valdric
    short: Grand Inquisitor hunting magic users. See [[Demo Notes]].
    long: |
      # Lord Valdric Ashmore

      **Age:** 52  
      **Role:** Primary Antagonist

      Grand Inquisitor of the Crown. Believes magic users are 
      abominations that must be controlled or eliminated.
    membership:
      narrative: antagonists
      political: inquisition
      magic: null
    connections:
      narrative:
        - to: marcus
          label: pursues
      political:
        - to: elena
          label: suspects
  elena:
    title: Elena Brightwater
    short: Court mage secretly aiding the rebellion and mentoring Kira. Her lessons focus on restraint, trust, and [[Demo Notes#Fire magic|controlling fire magic]] before either side can turn Kira into a weapon.
    long: |
      # Elena Brightwater

      Court mage who secretly sympathizes with the rebellion.
      Teaches Kira to control her abilities.
    membership:
      narrative: supporting
      political: royal-court
      magic: scholars
    connections:
      narrative:
        - to: valdric
          label: secretly opposes
      political:
        - to: kira
          label: aids
      magic:
        - to: kira
          label: teaches
  marcus:
    title: Marcus the Red
    short: A pragmatic rebel commander who sees Kira's power as the key to victory. He must balance the urgency of the uprising against the safety of villages caught between both armies. His plans put increasing pressure on Elena's secret work at court, while Kira questions whether winning at any cost will leave a kingdom worth saving. Read [the rebellion](Demo%20Notes.md#The%20rebellion) for background.
    long: |
      # Marcus the Red

      Leader of the Northern Rebellion. Pragmatic commander 
      who sees Kira's power as key to victory.
    membership:
      narrative: supporting
      political: northern-rebels
      magic: null
    connections:
      narrative:
        - to: kira
          label: recruits
      political:
        - to: valdric
          label: null
  temple-amulet:
    title: The Ember Heart
    short: Ancient artifact that massively amplifies fire magic; sought by both factions.
    long: |
      # The Ember Heart

      Ancient artifact said to amplify fire magic tenfold.
      Both sides race to find it.
    membership:
      narrative: null
      political: null
      magic: artificers
    connections:
      magic:
        - to: firestone
          label: amplifies
  firestone:
    title: Firestone Magic
    short: Emotion-driven fire magic system where passion must be balanced against self-destruction.
    long: |
      # Firestone Magic System

      Magic flows from emotional intensity. Fire users must 
      balance passion with control or risk self-immolation.
    membership:
      narrative: null
      political: null
      magic: innate-users
    connections: {}
